creatures:
- name: Ghost
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 11  
      **Hit Points** 45 (rollable(dice=10d8,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 5 ft., Fly 40 ft. (hover)  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Initiative) (11)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=7)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Damage Resistances** acid, bludgeoning, cold, fire, lightning, piercing, slashing, thunder  
      **Damage Immunities** necrotic, poison  
      **Condition Immunities** charmed, exhaustion, frightened, grappled, paralyzed, petrified, poisoned, prone, restrained  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 11  
      **Languages** Common plus one other language  
      **Challenge** 4 (1,100 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Ethereal Sight.*** The ghost can see 60 feet into the Ethereal Plane when it is on the Material Plane.

      ***Incorporeal Movement.*** The ghost can move through other creatures and objects as if they were ***Difficult Terrain***. It takes rollable(dice=1d10,dicelabel=Damage [Incorporeal Movement]) Force damage if it ends its turn inside an object.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The ghost makes two Withering Touch attacks.

      ***Withering Touch.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Withering Touch]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d10+3,dicelabel=Damage [Withering Touch]) Necrotic damage.

      ***Horrific Visage.*** *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 13, each creature in a 60-foot ***Cone*** that can see the ghost and isn't an Undead. *Failure:* rollable(dice=2d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Horrific Visage]) Psychic damage, and the target has the ***Frightened*** condition until the start of the ghost's next turn. *Success:* The target is immune to this ghost's Horrific Visage for 24 hours.

      ***Possession (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 6,dicelabel=Recharge [Possession])).*** *Charisma Saving Throw:* DC 13, one Humanoid the ghost can see within 5 feet. *Failure:* The target is possessed by the ghost; the ghost disappears, and the target has the ***Incapacitated*** condition and loses control of its body. The ghost now controls the body, but the target retains awareness. The ghost can't be targeted by any attack, spell, or other effect, except ones that specifically target Undead. The ghost's game statistics are the same, except it uses the possessed target's ***Speed***, as well as the target's Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution modifiers.

      The possession lasts until the body drops to 0 ***Hit Points*** or the ghost leaves as a ***Bonus Action***. When the possession ends, the ghost appears in an unoccupied space within 5 feet of the target, and the target is immune to this ghost's ***Possession*** for 24 hours. *Success:* The target is immune to this ghost's ***Possession*** for 24 hours.

      ***Etherealness.*** The ghost casts the [Etherealness](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619193-etherealness) spell, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability. The ghost is visible on the Material Plane while on the Border Ethereal and vice versa, but it can't affect or be affected by anything on the other plane.

      At will: [Etherealness](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619193-etherealness)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Medium Undead, Neutral*  
    **Challenge** 4
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024ghost
  status: 1

